Subject: [PATCH 4/5] Web client: the display contract of cancels, arrivals and
 costs, and the slot for nations' cooperation

hud/statusview.mjs words the states workstreams 04 and 05 own (a cancel's
three stages, an unverified arrival apart from a partial one, the four kinds
of a cost, the switch back to manual play) from plain objects whose fields it
names and checks: a stage it does not know or a field left out is shown as
"not received", never guessed. hud/coopentry.mjs is one slot in the S1
village card, under the nation's council, that workstream 01 fills; with no
entry registered the page is as it was.

